ht not be  complete yet  and we know kawaki does have a karma  later in the time skip we just don't  know exactly how it comes back  since we're still learning about the  otsutsuki and these karma marks as we go  finally sasuke enters the freight to  help out kawaki but with naruto  seemingly  out of commission after using baryon  mode it would seem they're still  hopelessly outmatched you gotta respect  sasuke  though he shrugs off a lost eye and gets  back into action like it's no big deal  now we get that precious info about the  karma and that  even if it vanishes that otutsuki data  still remains  in the body as with boruto the process  was 80 percent complete with kawaki  before the karma was removed but it  still means that his body is almost  wholly otozuki at this point this may  mean enhanced powers which is always a  good thing in naruto  but it also means that boroshiki plans  to use kawaki as an otsutsuki sacrifice  to cultivate a divine tree it seems like  the battle totsuki always wants to plant  planet-destroying trees and eat their  fruit so they can become even stronger  it's funny because even if ishiki is  gone  borushiki is pretty much just picking up  where he left off with his plan  kawaki is sick of people using them as  objects or more accurately sacrificial  pawns in their plans but these ototsuki  use their  powers to get what they want so if you  want to resist you gotta beat them you  gotta become stronger or at least  outsmart them i do like the double-edged  sword nature of the ottutsuki and the  karma  clearly people can be turned into  sacrifices for the needs of the  otsutsuki but  they also get huge power boosts and  those power boosts can seemingly stay  even if the karma gets extracted so  that's pretty cool  not gonna lie as kawaki is forming his  arm  into a blade for battle we jump to  naruto who is seriously in bad  shape understandably so after all of  kurama's warnings  about using baryon mode i do want to  hear more from t