red  about him and no one would accept him  kawaki surrounds himself in  fire to the point where he's burning  himself because he's a very valuable  piece for momoshiki  he can't let him die and so he uses the  karma to absorb the fire ninjutsu  that's how much kawaki has come to  respect and care about boruto  he's willing to risk sacrificing his own  life to free boruto from momoshiki's  control  boroshiki takes the bait and a burned  and injured kawaki falls down  boroshiki realizes that after absorbing  that chakra he's gotta act  quick because boruto is about to wake up  just as boroshiki is going to use  space-time ninjutsu to transport kawaki  he stops and we find out that boruto is  now awake and he tells momoshiki that  that's enough  it's funny how chill he is about it he  doesn't scream or freak out at momoshiki  or anything just  calmly lets him know that it's enough  then when momoshiki refuses to just  peace out  boruto takes the otsutsuki horn on his  head and breaks it  and that is enough to make momoshiki go  back to sleep  boruto collapses next to kawaki and at  this point the bromance is going  so strong i'm so curious about how these  two will drift apart during the time  skip because right now  as the title suggests they are as close  as brothers  willing to risk their own lies for each  other crazy to think that kawaki  will go from risking his life to wake up  boruto to fighting against him and  seemingly becoming the villain of the  series  let me know why you think he'll turn  against boruto if you have any  theories in the comments i'd love to  read them in a hilarious and not gonna  lie  heartwarming moment burto apologizes for  causing trouble and kawaki  says back at you stupid bro so he has  that bit of a tsundere  edge that vegeta never loses in dragon  ball z but he still called him bro  symbolically fully accepting boruto's  offer of friendship and even brotherhood  sasuke glad they survived remembers  naruto and goes to check on him